---

## Full <small>(modular, with plugin manager)</small>

The modular edition: the `revela` host executable plus a `packages/` folder that contains every official plugin and theme as a separate `.nupkg` file. Revela uses that folder as a local, offline package feed (`bundled`), so `revela plugin install`/`uninstall` add and remove plugins without any internet connection. Useful if you want to ship custom plugins or mix and match themes.

**Pick this if:** you want to add or build custom plugins, or you prefer a smaller running footprint with plugins loaded on demand.

